sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Vault as YieldVaultMultiAsset<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant Aave as Aave V3 Pool<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant RSC as YieldOptimizerRsc<br/>(Lasna)
    participant Callback as Callback Proxy<br/>(Sepolia)

    Note over User,Callback: Yield Monitoring and Rebalancing Flow

    User->>Vault: triggerYieldSnapshot()
    Vault->>Aave: getReserveData(asset)
    Aave-->>Vault: liquidityRate, APY data
    Vault->>Vault: Calculate APYs for all assets
    Vault-->>RSC: emit YieldSnapshot(assetIds, apys, allocations)
    
    Note over RSC: RSC analyzes yield data
    RSC->>RSC: Compare APYs across assets
    RSC->>RSC: Determine optimal allocation
    
    alt Yield difference exceeds threshold
        RSC->>Callback: emit Callback(executeRebalance)
        Callback->>Vault: executeRebalance(newAllocations)
        Vault->>Vault: Update asset allocations
        Vault-->>User: Funds rebalanced to higher yield
    else Yield difference below threshold
        Note over RSC: No rebalance needed
    end
